AlphaServer
running Digital Unix 4.0b due to the huge file size (about 60 MB). And
all the messages  giving in about CAM (SCSI) events and this message
repeated in every 5 minutes and logged in binary.errlog.

But after this procedure it seems that system does not re-generata
binary.errlog. Is that expectable.? or should I re-run some daemon to
regenarte this file??

and also I would like to delete binary.errlog file by using find command
and put it into crontab entry. Is there any sample script for executing
this procedure.

